a of Japan, market food, rice, and regional sake.</description></item><item><title>富士山環湖：河口湖慢騎</title><link>https://saligiare-pwd.github.io/travel-portfolio/destinations/japan/fuji-lake/fuji-kawaguchiko-loop/</link><pubDate>Wed, 30 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://saligiare-pwd.github.io/travel-portfolio/destinations/japan/fuji-lake/fuji-kawaguchiko-loop/</guid><description>以河口湖站為起點，沿湖北岸展望點完成一圈可以隨時縮短的自行車行程。</description></item><item><title>江之島：海岸、神社與夕陽</title><link>https://saligiare-pwd.github.io/travel-portfolio/destinations/japan/enoshima/enoshima-day-trip/</link><pubDate>Wed, 30 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://saligiare-pwd.github.io/travel-portfolio/destinations/japan/enoshima/enoshima-day-trip/</guid><description>從東京出發的一日海岸散步，沿著神社、展望台與岩岸走到日落。</description></item><item><title>綠島潛水：三天海島節奏</title><link>https://saligiare-pwd.github.io/travel-portfolio/destinations/taiwan/e/green-island/green-island-diving/</link><pubDate>Wed, 30 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://saligiare-pwd.github.io/travel-portfolio/destinations/taiwan/e/green-island/green-island-diving/</guid><description>把抵達、岸潛與環島分開安排，讓潛水安全與海況決定每天的順序。</description></item><item><title>合歡山：清境轉乘與高山步道</title><link>https://saligiare-pwd.github.io/travel-portfolio/destinations/taiwan/m/hehuanshan-basics/hehuanshan-trip/</link><pubDate>Wed, 08 Oct 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://saligiare-pwd.github.io/travel-portfolio/destinations/taiwan/m/hehuanshan-basics/hehuanshan-trip/</guid><description>從台中經清境進入合歡山，以接駁、天候與高度適應為核心的三日安排。</description></item><item><title>礁溪：溫泉、瀑布與宜蘭味</title><link>https://saligiare-pwd.github.io/travel-portfolio/destinations/taiwan/n/jiaoxi-basics/jiaoxi-trip/</link><pubDate>Wed, 08 Oct 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://saligiare-pwd.github.io/travel-portfolio/destinations/taiwan/n/jiaoxi-basics/jiaoxi-trip/</guid><description>從台北搭客運到礁溪，串連湯圍溝、五峰旗與糕渣、烤鴨、三星蔥料理。</description></item><item><title>花蓮：海岸、日出與慢行</title><link>https://saligiare-pw